{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300eRX10-40\u300f(RX ten forty) is a third-person shooter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/2945adee4cde6eb73c0f57c6b80963d4.poster.avif?t=1772317296\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/2945adee4cde6eb73c0f57c6b80963d4.webm?t=1772317296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/2945adee4cde6eb73c0f57c6b80963d4.mp4?t=1772317296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features of\u300eRX10-40\u300f</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, linear, orthodox TPS. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot with a gun, defend with a shield, attack in close range with a baton stun gun, and finish with a super attack. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By prohibiting aiming up and down when shooting, jumping and crouching are encouraged, making for more dynamic play. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/753296d086f6eb314581ba13c695bf4c.webp?t=1772317296\" width=609 height=30 /></span><i> </i> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/33607ca2858b5cb33972be2a52870564.poster.avif?t=1772317296\" width=608 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693880/extras/33607ca2858b5cb33972be2a52870564.webm?t=1772317296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akam